{{h1}}Mustache

Mustache is a logic-less template syntax. Chevron is a Python implementation; other implementations may support optional extensions.

{{h2}}Authoring
- Use variables, sections, inverted sections, and partials within the supported specification.
- Keep decisions and transformation in the view data rather than templates.
- Confirm escaping and partial-loading behaviour in the configured implementation.
- Preserve whitespace conventions and validate rendered output.

{{h2}}Reference
- [Mustache specification](https://github.com/mustache/spec)
- [Mustache implementations](https://mustache.github.io/)
